{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_04D7E0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"“The Ghost in the Machine”是什么意思？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"嗯……那是哲学家Gilbert Ryle说过的话。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"你知道Descartes吧？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":24,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"“我思，故我在”……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"对。他是提出身心二元论的哲学家。Descartes认为，会“思考”的心灵与受物理法则支配的身体处在不同维度。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":144,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"但如果这是真的，那么人类岂不就是“身体”这台<R=机器,MACHINE>中寄宿着名为“心灵”的<R=幽灵,GHOST>吗？","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=机器,MACHINE>\", \"<R=幽灵,GHOST>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":139,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"人类不该是这种东西……Ryle就是这样批判的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":61,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"那你为什么会说这个？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":30,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"我说那句话时，并没有特意想到Ryle。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":49,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"我只是觉得，如果人是由<R=机器,MACHINE>和<R=幽灵,GHOST>构成的，也许反过来也可能成立。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=机器,MACHINE>\", \"<R=幽灵,GHOST>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":115,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"也就是说，在<R=机器,MACHINE>中寄宿<R=灵魂,GHOST>，或许就能诞生一个“人”。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=机器,MACHINE>\", \"<R=灵魂,GHOST>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":100,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"你是说，那就是The Boss的AI？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":37,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"那时记忆板已经被你拔掉，Mammal Pod也停止了。本来不可能再动。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":85,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"可即便如此，Peace Walker还是站了起来，一边唱着和平之歌。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"那一刻，我怎么都觉得……她的灵魂寄宿在Peace Walker里。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":""}]}